    "comment": "Remun (9789-lkj) = Vulnerable (100 percent certain, based on the evidence available) (The Remun inhabit a complex polyglossic linguistic environment and most interact using a variety of codes on a daily basis. Outside of Kampong Remun, the younger generation uses Iban almost exclusively. The area used in this study represents the core of Ramun resistance to Iban linguistic influence.) [Cullip 2000](cldf:cullip:00)"
